{"title":"Sunbleached Fang","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Sand Jackal, Dune Alpha, Desert Wolf</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"dune-alpha\" title=\"Dune Alpha - dropped it in 3 of 4 looted corpses (1/1.3)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/a30ad945729791035484.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Alpha</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.3<br>×2–3</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"sand-jackal\" title=\"Sand Jackal - dropped it in 29 of 54 looted corpses (1/1.9)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/bb7ca40cbe335f3fe02d.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sand Jackal</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.9<br>×1–8</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"desert-wolf\" title=\"Desert Wolf - dropped it in 2 of 4 looted corpses (1/2)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/c329d1e5ab8da9dd114c.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Desert Wolf</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1–8</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"sunbleached-fang\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/87ff80ab6feed9f385f8.svg\" alt=\"Sunbleached Fang\"></div><h3>Sunbleached Fang</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by